From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caskade <caskade@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:49:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep selecting past a text input's edge, and select a word on
 long press

- A mouse drag that began in the focused text input stopped extending its
  selection as soon as the pointer left the input (or hit nothing): text
  beyond a narrow input's edge couldn't be selected by dragging. The input
  now keeps the drag, as if it captured the pointer.
- Touch had no way to select: a moving finger pans. A finger resting on
  the focused input for half a second selects the word under it when it
  lifts, as a long press does.

Tests in `text_input_selection.rs`.
